This program uses two modified binary search algorithms to find the first and last occurrences of the lower and upper values, respectively. The `findFirstOccurrence` method finds the first occurrence of a value greater than or equal to the target, while the `findLastOccurrence` method finds the last occurrence of a value less than or equal to the target. Both methods also keep track of the first occurrence of the unique value among duplicates.

