### Instruction:
Write a JavaScript code to copy an array including its elements. However, the copied array should only contain odd numbers from the original array and should be sorted in ascending order. If the original array does not contain any odd numbers, return an empty array. The code should use recursion to perform the sorting operation and should have a time complexity of O(n log n), where n is the length of the original array. Additionally, the code should not use any built-in array sorting functions or methods. 

