### Response:
To find the kth smallest element in a set of positive integers, you can use the concept of binary search. Here is a program in Java that implements this approach:

```java
import java.util.Arrays;

public class KthSmallestElement {
    public static int findKthSmallest(int[] numbers, int k) {
        // Sort the array in ascending order
        Arrays.sort(numbers);

        // Return the kth smallest element
        return numbers[k - 1];
    }

    public static void main(String[] args) {
